## 1. 常用速查表
### 1.1 Keras 层速查

| 层 | 用途 | 关键参数 |
|----|------|---------|
| Dense | 全连接 | units, activation |
| Conv2D | 卷积 | filters, kernel_size, strides |
| MaxPooling2D | 池化 | pool_size |
| BatchNormalization | 归一化 | momentum, epsilon |
| Dropout | 正则化 | rate |
| Embedding | 词嵌入 | input_dim, output_dim |
| LSTM/GRU | 循环层 | units, return_sequences |
| MultiHeadAttention | 注意力 | num_heads, key_dim |
| LayerNormalization | 层归一化 | epsilon |
| Concatenate/Multiply | 合并 | axis |
### 1.2 tf.data 速查

```python
# 完整管线
dataset = (
    tf.data.Dataset. from_tensor_slices((x, y))
    .shuffle(10000)              # 随机打乱
    .map(preprocess, num_parallel_...=tf.data.AUTOTUNE)  # 并行处理
    .cache()                     # 缓存
    .batch(32, drop_remainder=True)  # 定长 batch
    .prefetch(tf.data.AUTOTUNE)  # 预取
)
```
